# Local planning/tracking docs — kept on disk for cross-session memory, never pushed.
# These are internal working memory, not submission deliverables. Everything
# else in markdown (README.md, evals/RESULTS.md, docs/*.md — all explicitly
# required submission artifacts per the plan's Phase 10/11) IS tracked; this
# rule used to be a blanket `*.md` / `!README.md`, which was too broad and
# would have silently excluded those required files too (caught while
# building Phase 10's eval suite — see phase-summary.md's decisions log).
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/phase.md
/phase-summary.md
/implementation-plan.md
/incident-commander.md
/implementation-plan-review.md
/details.md

# Raw per-run eval trace logs — verbose mechanical evidence, not the deliverable.
# evals/RESULTS.md (the aggregated pass/fail summary) is what's committed.
/evals/traces/
